iven-names>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Gall</surname><given-names>DG</given-names></name><name><surname>MacNaughton</surname><given-names>WK</given-names></name><name><surname>Beck</surname><given-names>PL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Aquaporin expression is downregulated in a murine model of colitis and in patients with ulcerative colitis, Crohn&#x02019;s disease and colitis</article-title><source>Cell Tissue Res</source><year>2004</year><volume>318</volume><fpage>313</fpage><lpage>323</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15338270</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b7-ijerph-05-00115"><label>7</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dempsey</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Meise</surname><given-names>KS</given-names></name><name><surname>Coffey</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Basolateral sorting of transforming growth factor-alpha precursor in polarized epithelial cells: characterization of cytoplasmic domain determinants</article-title><source>Exp Cell Res</source><year>2003</year><volume>285</volume><fpage>159</fpage><lpage>174</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12706112</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b8-ijerph-05-00115"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Le Mount</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Welling</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name><name><surname>Brejon</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Olsen</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Merot</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Basolateral membrane expression of a K+ channel, Kir 2.3, is directed by a cytoplasmic COOH-terminal domain</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci USA</source><year>2001</year><volume>98</volume><fpage>10475<